# Only the reviewed sources may reach the image. The patterns apply at every depth: a git-ignored file does not
# show in `git status`, yet would otherwise be copied; Vite, for one, compiles the variables of a .env file into
# the bundle.
**/node_modules
dist
e2e
**/.env*
**/.vite
**/.git
**/secrets
**/certs
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.crt
**/*.log
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
